Zotero 10.0.6 reference installation: licence and corresponding source

Zotero-10.0.6_linux-x86_64.tar.xz in this directory is the official Linux x86_64 release archive of Zotero 10.0.6
(https://download.zotero.org/client/release/10.0.6/Zotero-10.0.6_linux-x86_64.tar.xz, 118,303,588 bytes, sha256
246c2574a9ac526abeaf3027ffd22fc45536a5ab25f227bb1df932fca9cedd63), redistributed as downloaded. solve.sh verifies
its digest and unpacks it unchanged into /app/solution/zotero. This repository's own files (start.sh,
launch.py, solve.sh) are not part of Zotero: launch.py writes the profile's user.js before every start
(data directory, local HTTP server on PORT with the local API enabled, online services and first-run notices off,
reduced motion, developer tools and add-on installation disabled), records the runtime's local API key in the
profile's localAPIKeys.json and runs the release's own zotero launcher script. The product itself is not changed.

